{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"So <@!260820438026813440> and <@!692746345387130900>, I was writing my events, and when i showed Radar a part of one of my writeups he said in case its helpful, tell you.  So in one of my events, there is a chance players will be captured and caged.  So its not quite so simple for shadows to just, leave the cage, i had put this bit in:\n```The entire cage is brightly lit, to a point no one in it casts a shadow on any surface.```\n\nSo in case there is something you are writing that the shadows could make trivial, that you don't want to be trivial in that way, make sure to write in a mechanism to deal with that.  If you already are, I apologize for the ping, but I wanted to bring it up just in case it helps.","created_at":"2021-06-02T22:01:01.341000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"849769603127181312","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
